1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:03,200
Tamil, one of the oldest living languages,

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:05,090
is fading from temple walls.

3
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:09,170
In 2021, India had about 23 epigraphists.

4
00:00:09,241 --> 00:00:10,901
So I built Ezhuthu,

5
00:00:10,921 --> 00:00:12,041
an apprentice.

6
00:00:12,061 --> 00:00:14,681
A team of Strands agents reads the stone,

7
00:00:14,701 --> 00:00:15,725
letter by letter.

8
00:00:15,745 --> 00:00:18,885
Lost letters? It checks thousands of parallels,

9
00:00:18,905 --> 00:00:20,656
and fills only when sure.

10
00:00:20,676 --> 00:00:24,115
Nine in ten fills match the editors' restoration.

11
00:00:24,135 --> 00:00:25,655
It explains the meaning,

12
00:00:25,675 --> 00:00:27,405
and teaches you to read it.
